{"3034050": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Astra Moment:DIMENSION", "steam_appid": 3034050, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >···This is the navigator, please respond.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >『Astra Moment:DIMENSION』 is a keyboard-type rhythm game with four lanes. Experience the new play experience of SF rhythm games with original music by students from Jeonghwa University of the Arts, a dimension note system with vibes processed in the air, and operators to help you play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a play material using general notes and dimension notes.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3034050/extras/4a4b1a0d8e9e9a970697426da74f4a18.poster.avif?t=1755875880\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3034050/extras/4a4b1a0d8e9e9a970697426da74f4a18.webm?t=1755875880\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3034050/extras/4a4b1a0d8e9e9a970697426da74f4a18.mp4?t=1755875880\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3034050/extras/f83d0e0b723499b886aca81fbd82000d.poster.avif?t=1755875880\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3034050/extras/f83d0e0b723499b886aca81fbd82000d.webm?t=1755875880\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3034050/extras/f83d0e0b723499b886aca81fbd82000d.mp4?t=1755875880\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4KEY PLAYING METHOD OF FALLING TYPE</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It consists of EASY, NORMAL, and HARD in one song, and it is a basic 4-key falling rhythm game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By entering the specified key (default SPACE BAR) operation, you can handle the dimension notes that fall on the line.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of music that is not limited to the genre</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Astra Moment:DIMENSION updates selected songs through a contest held by the Department of Practical Music at Jeonghwa Arts University. Play satisfactory with new and attractive songs.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ranking Leaderboard Competition System</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the play is completed, the user's rating will be aggregated according to the unique system of Astra Moment:DIMENSION. The aggregated information can be checked by the ranking leaderboard, which can check the records of other competitors.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >···This is the navigator, please respond.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >『Astra Moment:DIMENSION』 is a keyboard-type rhythm game with four lanes. Experience the new play experience of SF rhythm games with original music by students from Jeonghwa University of the Arts, a dimension note system with vibes processed in the air, and operators to help you play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a play material using general notes and dimension notes.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3034050/extras/4a