 completed, the user's rating will be aggregated according to the unique system of Astra Moment:DIMENSION. The aggregated information can be checked by the ranking leaderboard, which can check the records of other competitors.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "『Astra Moment:DIMENSION』 is a keyboard-type rhythm game with four lanes. Experience the new play experience of SF rhythm games with original music by students from Jeonghwa University of the Arts, a dimension note system with vibes processed in the air, and operators to help you play.", "supported_languages": "English, Japanese, Korean", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3034050/header.jpg?t=1755875880", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3034050/c1889093f6df8a5fc7dbc3ac36af7c2ac6bab14d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755875880", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3034050/c1889093f6df8a5fc7dbc3ac36af7c2ac6bab14d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755875880", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7, 8.1, 10 (64bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core 2 Duo E8400 3.0GHz AMD Athlon 64 X2 6000+ 3.0GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia® GTX 460 or AMD HD 5850 or better<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Realtek</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core 2 Duo E8400 3.0GHz AMD Athlon 64 X2 6000+ 3.0GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2